{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs34 List of Instruments and Effects\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Created in response to the KVR One Synth Challenge competition, which requires providing technical details of the production.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 It lists and counts all REAPER plugins used in an active project, grouping them into categories:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Instruments,\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Effects,\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Input FX,\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Monitoring,\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Offline/Inactive\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The script collects plugins from:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls2\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} track inputs and inserts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls2\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} master and monitoring\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls2\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} media item/takes\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls2\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} FX containers (nested included)\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Results are presented in the window allowing to copy them to clipboard in several formats:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls3\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} {\b plain text} -- just a plain text\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls3\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} {\b markdown} -- results formatted into Markdown tables\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls3\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} {\b BB plain} -- uses BBCode formatting, such as bold\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls3\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} {\b BB code} -- wrapped in {\f1 \fs24 [CODE]} tags to force a fixed-width font\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The report is built when the window opens, and rebuilt whenever you press a Copy button or toggle {\f1 \fs24 debug}. Each rebuild reads the project you are looking at now, so it picks up a switch to another project tab. Normally the window shows plain text whichever export format you copy; tick {\f1 \fs24 debug} to make it show exactly what goes to the clipboard.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The \u9432 ? button shows the version, the licence and a link to the documentation.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Requires {\b ReaImGui 0.10 or newer}, available on ReaPack. Nothing else -- neither Lokasenna's GUI library nor SWS is needed any more.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Written and tested in REAPER 7.x; it may work in earlier versions. GPL v3.\par}
}
